{"unit_id":"tenkrol__dsh_locale_ru#card-zh","repo":"tenkrol/dsh_locale_ru","commit":"97e4898174bd0a3120f4cad24ef25dc191dcce9e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-locale-ru 是 DSH 网页界面的俄语语言包。它通过客户端语言服务登记“Русский”，并为多个界面命名空间提供俄文词条，未翻译内容回退到英语。可本地化设置、会话、模型、插件目录和侧边栏等界面文字，适合希望用俄语操作 DSH 的用户。语言包随 DSH bundle 加载，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3112-3120","dictionaries/settings.locale.json:1-3","dictionaries/pluginMarket.json:1-18"]}
{"unit_id":"tenkrol__dsh_locale_ru#card-en","repo":"tenkrol/dsh_locale_ru","commit":"97e4898174bd0a3120f4cad24ef25dc191dcce9e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-locale-ru adds a Russian option to the DSH web interface. Its client registers the language and supplies translated strings for settings, sessions, model configuration, the plugin catalog, and the sidebar. Untranslated entries fall back to English. For Russian speakers; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:3112-3120","dictionaries/settings.locale.json:1-3","dictionaries/pluginMarket.json:1-18"]}
